      "rationale": "The central claim 'No extant work combines probe-based internal-state measurement with causal-interventional measurement on the same instances' is factually wrong — at minimum, 2412.01113 (EACL 2026) and 2602.03994 both combine probing + causal interventions on the same CoT instances. The remaining novelty (five-phenomenon unification, TIF score, systematic dual-TIC signatures) is moderate but not as groundbreaking as presented."
