      "score": 3,
      "rationale": "An instance-level faithfulness diagnostic grounded in the probe-intervention gap would be impactful IF the conceptual foundation holds. But the diagnostic-not-causal challenge (2605.09502) and the existence of prior probe+intervention work weaken the impact claim. The early-exit component faces strong competition from Reasoning Theater (80% savings on MMLU) and multiple other methods."
